    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "生成中的认识经内容、实际根据、相关错误和可修订标准形成；G0 与公开 J1–J4/E 连接其生活意义。前沿进一步检验：所得信息、因果作用、可出错的内容及对根据的理解怎样在同一形成史中分化；相关挑战应能选择性改变信赖、断言或实践回应。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing forms through content, actual grounds, relevant error and revisable standards; G0 and explicit J1–J4/E connect its place in living. The frontier distinguishes available information, causal use, content through error and understanding of grounds within one history; relevant challenges should selectively affect reliance, assertion or practical response.",
    "scope_zh": "相连哲学候选保留完成范围；本轮两项实证与两项哲学原典比较、四项公开数据统计量复核。无新定理、新实验或独立 agent 验收；既有20／34及8／13实查包保留原范围。新的选择性修订比较尚未执行；普遍语义充分性、意识、一般归纳及整套理论必要性仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "The connected philosophical proposal retains its completed scope. Two empirical and two philosophical primary comparisons plus four selected statistic reproductions advance its adequacy assessment. No new theorem, experiment or independent-agent acceptance; inherited 20/34 and 8/13 proof packages retain their scopes. The new selective-revision comparison is unrun. Universal semantics, consciousness, general induction and whole-theory necessity remain open.",
